WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.009 line:8%
Open Admissions and select the application you need to review.

00:00:05.016 --> 00:00:11.279 line:8%
Check the applicant and intake, then choose the appropriate decision and enter the requested reason.

00:00:12.292 --> 00:00:14.876 line:8%
Confirm and check the resulting status.

00:00:14.876 --> 00:00:23.059 line:8%
Acceptance creates the student and enrolment using the intake's current fee plan; other decisions do not record a payment.
